bug_investigation_logs |bug_id, line_num, content|
    mir_let_annotated_result_overwritten_by_join_metadata_2026-11-12, 0, "2026-11-27 w4-1: extracted remember_let_init_hir_metadata_v1 (src/compiler/50.mir/mir_lowering_stmts.spl:4875) above let_declared_type_override_v1 (:4894) and synced both early-Let (:2160) and ordinary case Let (:2521) arms (shard previously left stale open at line 1799). Verified sequentially via simple.exe --mode=interpreter: let_annotated_result_join_type_spec.spl 13/13 PASS (MIR JSON I64 with zero U8 cast targets on arr[0]/take_i64, mixed mk/Ok arms, if-val join, any-payload guard, HmInferContext type-mismatch check, and 200+300=500 execution in seed + core_interpret), early_let_receiver_metadata_spec.spl 5/5, annotated_let_from_optional_arm_spec.spl 2/2, untyped_if_result_ctor_join_spec.spl 11/11, array_slice_min_max_lowering_spec.spl 14/14, if_val_match_diverging_value_type_spec.spl 9/9 (result_unwrap_struct_provenance_spec.spl 5/6 pre-existing identical failure on base HEAD). waiting-for: Stage-2/LLVM compiled execution of the Result<i64, text> unwrap repro (MirInterpreter lacks rt_enum_new) and Linux self-host bootstrap check."
    mir_let_annotated_result_overwritten_by_join_metadata_2026-11-12, 0, "2026-11-28 p3sweep7: both execution lanes (source-run + compiled .smf) print 500 for all four doc shapes at tip - the W4-1 fix is in this branch's history. Root cause (historical): let_declared_type_override_v1 returned 0 for Result initializers, so both Let arms copied the join type's HIR metadata over the declared annotation and r.unwrap() lowered as U8 via result_ok_hir_type; override 4 (mir_lowering_stmts.spl:4878+) copies initializer metadata but re-records the declared type; any payloads keep the old behavior. RED proven by transiently neutralizing the override (probe 4/6 fails with the exact filed signature: no temp carries Result<i64,text>, unwrap temp HIR u8/MIR U8) then restored byte-exact; seed-side unaffected (its Let lowering uses the slot's declared type, verified both lanes). Added let_annotated_result_join_type_seed_spec 10/10 PASS (fresh-seed-runnable companion). Neighbours untyped_if_result_ctor_join 11/11, early_let_receiver_metadata 5/5, annotated_let_from_optional_arm 2/2, if_val_match_diverging 9/9. Residuals: pre-existing eval-vs-eval_units circular value import blocks ~20 interpreter specs incl the primary spec's core_interpret example (another lane's 113ea0e0f0d); seed --native lane unusable on this host (rt_value_eq missing, pre-existing); self-host/MC-DC verification remains per the doc. close_evidence reproducer=test/01_unit/compiler/mir/let_annotated_result_join_type_seed_spec.spl prevention=src/compiler/50.mir/mir_lowering_stmts.spl"

